(a) If the city determines that an applicant or other responsible person has failed to comply with the terms and conditions of a permit or has failed to comply with any of the provisions of this UDO, it must issue a written notice of violation to the applicant or other responsible person. Where a person is engaged in activity covered by this UDO without having first secured a permit for that activity, the notice of violation will be served on the owner or the responsible person in charge of the activity being conducted on the site.
